{"ID":"20240118151430-wbjkkq0","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240118151430-wbjkkq0","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151430-wbjkkq0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151430-b9eqxbm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119114933-yhj1g7p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:41,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119114933-yhj1g7p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:88,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:88\u0026#125;","title":"009石胆（又名胆矾）","type":"doc","updated":"20240125093507"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151430-b9eqxbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151430-b9eqxbm","updated":"20240119114849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味酸寒，主明目目痛金创，诸痫痉，女子阴蚀痛，石淋寒热，崩中下血，诸邪毒气，令人有子，炼饵服之不老，久服增寿神仙。能化铁为铜成金银。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114802-o7wvlxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114802-o7wvlxj","updated":"20240119114848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"神农酸小寒，扁鹊苦无毒，周礼疡医凡疗疡以五毒攻之，石胆丹砂雄黄矾石慈石其中烧之三日三夜，其烟上着以鸡羽扫取之，以注创恶肉破骨则尽出。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114809-pkdsyu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114809-pkdsyu7","updated":"20240119114850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产山中，为蓝色结晶。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114813-76udpyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114813-76udpyr","updated":"20240119114850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味酸辛，性寒，有小毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114814-wayhnub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114814-wayhnub","updated":"20240119114851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】胆矾为腐蚀催吐要药，功能蚀恶疮散症积，涌吐风痰，治咽喉口鼻疮毒及目患。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114816-sc75yqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114816-sc75yqf","updated":"20240119114852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】治虫牙，鼻内息肉。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114818-cv17vp6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114818-cv17vp6","updated":"20240119114853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏颂】入吐风痰药最快。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114819-ifl0nda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114819-ifl0nda","updated":"20240119114854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】入煎剂一钱至二钱，研末服一分许。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114821-73g43td","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114821-73g43td","updated":"20240119114855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】胃弱人不宜多服。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114822-plqmint","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114822-plqmint","updated":"20240119114855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【吴克潜】胆矾有腐蚀性与收敛性，故能治恶疮，吐顽痰，喉痹欲死，研末醋调灌之，大吐胶痰而愈。治狐臭，胆矾枯矾各一钱，轻粉百药煎各五分，为细末敷之效，著名方剂有铁桶膏（铜绿胆矾五倍子白芷轻粉郁金麝香）治发背将溃时，根脚走散不收者，用以涂疮四周根上效。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114831-8jekz70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114831-8jekz70","updated":"20240119114856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【炮制】拣去杂质即可。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114826-es5xesc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114826-es5xesc"}},{"ID":"20240119114858-oolrjeg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114858-oolrjeg","updated":"20240125093231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石胆，就是我们所介绍的胆矾，是一样的东西，那它是产自铜坑，像这个石胆，空青，曾青，都是我们过去在产铜的那个矿区里，这地方产铜，里面附带就是这个石胆，所以商人去把铜拿去做成五金类的加工，他们挖铜矿时候，药商，就是采药的人，进去挖这个石胆跟空青，曾青。"}]},{"ID":"20240119114904-8j8y5lx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114904-8j8y5lx","updated":"20240125093306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石胆又名胆矾，它的味酸寒，主明目。胆矾，空青，曾青，这些过去还有朱砂，过去我们的书法家，都拿来做颜料，我讲过，都是铜坑产生，颜色是蓝色的，就叫做石胆；颜色是青色的，就是空青。"}]},{"ID":"20240119114915-j5v25bw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114915-j5v25bw","updated":"20240125093340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那老师很难区分那，蓝色和青色的，石胆是天蓝色，蓝色的结晶，很透，空青，颜色比较深一点，中国大陆过去穿的蓝色衣服，就是蓝的。"}]},{"ID":"20240119114916-kjeavrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114916-kjeavrs","updated":"20240125093409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石胆，除了内服以外，像我们外敷的，脓疡的，脓疡科里面，五毒来攻，我们皮肤化脓了，收不了口，像石胆丹砂雄黄矾石啊磁石，这样烧，烧过以后，取它的灰出来，这都是一些提炼的最早的一些化学方式。提炼一些药出来，所以说中医，过去本来就有化学，只是不像西洋系统的整理，过去就有化学。"}]},{"ID":"20240119114927-ky8zsd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114927-ky8zsd2","updated":"20240125093436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石胆，本身就是蓝色的结晶，味酸。临床上使用的时候，可以用它来做催吐，还有外用的，整个恶疮不能收口，统统可以用。因为它性味比较寒，药性比较寒凉，所以胃弱的人不能吃，少吃一点。"}]},{"ID":"20240119114933-yhj1g7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114933-yhj1g7p","updated":"20240125093507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【吴克潜】，近代的经方家，他能够用胆矾来治疗狐臭，比较经验的案例。列出来给你看，一个你可以开刀治疗狐臭，还不然找个先生喜欢闻那个味道的，海畔有逐臭之夫嘛，有的人喜欢那个味道，很迷人，还有一种用这个方式，来治疗狐臭，就在这个地方。"}]}]}